    <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Package" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation" xmi:uuid="5eab3dc1-b51c-5f52-b130-79142a70a1a1">
      <name>qualityAnnotation</name>
      <URI>https://w3id.org/cdif/bbr/metadata/qualityProperties/qualityAnnotation</URI>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation" xmi:uuid="d72b24a6-d513-5b8a-91c2-229966a94009">
        <name>QualityAnnotation</name>
        <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation.comment" xmi:uuid="e4d57421-83d0-5891-abd5-e7a3af4fca7f">
          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

A dqv:QualityAnnotation (a subclass of oa:Annotation) attaches a narrative or categorical quality statement -- a standards-compliance note, a rating, or a quality certificate -- to a resource. Unlike a dqv:QualityMeasurement it does not report a measured value against a named metric; the assertion lives in the annotation body.
:title: "definitions for a quality annotation property"
:rdfType: ``dqv:QualityAnnotation``
:typeOptional:
:noId:</body>
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation"/>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedAttribute xmi:type="uml:Property" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation.oa_hasBody" xmi:uuid="680b4aeb-5f41-5c0f-9954-b17f2d389734">
          <name>oa_hasBody</name>
          <type href="../../schemaorgProperties/definedTerm/definedTerm.xmi#cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.definedTerm.DefinedTerm"/>
          <lowerValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation.oa_hasBody.lower" xmi:uuid="a114eafd-9d7b-5c5e-b625-47834b4f3e97">
            <value>1</value>
          </lowerValue>
          <upperValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation.oa_hasBody.upper" xmi:uuid="cfcee9f3-04f6-5a55-83cd-0c685aa27800">
            <value>1</value>
          </upperValue>
          <association xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.assoc.QualityAnnotation_oa_hasBody_DefinedTerm"/>
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation.oa_hasBody.comment" xmi:uuid="c6fd84ef-2d68-5dc5-8f7e-c3c8ab822635">
            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

the content of the quality annotation -- a free-text statement, a categorical outcome as a Defined Term (e.g. a certification level or a pass/fail rating), or a reference to a separate body resource
:inlineOrByReference: ``inline``
:idRefDescription: "a resolvable reference to the annotation body"
:orReference: ["string", "value", "idReference"]
:jsonName: "oa:hasBody"</body>
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation.oa_hasBody"/>
          </ownedComment>
        </ownedAttribute>
        <ownedAttribute xmi:type="uml:Property" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation.oa_motivatedBy" xmi:uuid="a29e34bb-39a3-5aa9-820d-da28d75a0254">
          <name>oa_motivatedBy</name>
          <type href="../../schemaorgProperties/definedTerm/definedTerm.xmi#cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.definedTerm.DefinedTerm"/>
          <lowerValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation.oa_motivatedBy.lower" xmi:uuid="97e5ef46-949c-5091-993e-74ca4b173758">
            <value>0</value>
          </lowerValue>
          <upperValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation.oa_motivatedBy.upper" xmi:uuid="e48c18f6-7a19-5e81-ac47-2c511b4eb461">
            <value>1</value>
          </upperValue>
          <association xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.assoc.QualityAnnotation_oa_motivatedBy_DefinedTerm"/>
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation.oa_motivatedBy.comment" xmi:uuid="fb3fa2ec-e9a1-5286-8909-c3c90a3cc68a">
            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

why the annotation was made; for quality annotations this is normally the instance dqv:qualityAssessment, but any motivation IRI or Defined Term is allowed
:inlineOrByReference: ``inline``
:idRefDescription: "a resolvable reference to an oa:Motivation"
:orReference: ["string", "idReference", "value"]
:jsonName: "oa:motivatedBy"</body>
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation.oa_motivatedBy"/>
          </ownedComment>
        </ownedAttribute>
        <ownedAttribute xmi:type="uml:Property" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation.oa_hasTarget" xmi:uuid="0624e12e-03fa-5a6f-aeb6-086119c36a92">
          <name>oa_hasTarget</name>
          <type href="../../cdifCommonTypes.xmi#common.IdReference"/>
          <lowerValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralInteger" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation.oa_hasTarget.lower" xmi:uuid="a09d9525-96d7-5fcf-88fd-a8bccbeb3452">
            <value>0</value>
          </lowerValue>
          <upperValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation.oa_hasTarget.upper" xmi:uuid="793a1fd0-a33f-584e-be73-e86c6edb5484">
            <value>1</value>
          </upperValue>
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation.oa_hasTarget.comment" xmi:uuid="9a52f01f-1106-5406-acb8-950288e3ec57">
            <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

the resource the annotation is about; if omitted, the annotation is about the resource that carries it (e.g. the Dataset)
:idRefDescription: "a resolvable reference to the annotated resource"
:jsonName: "oa:hasTarget"</body>
            <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.qualityProperties.qualityAnnotation.QualityAnnotation.oa_hasTarget"/>
          </ownedComment>
        </ownedAttribute>
